---
// End-of-post CTA driving to /ai-readiness-snapshot.
//
// Rendered by src/pages/blog/[...slug].astro on every post. 135 of the 137
// posts are .md rather than .mdx, so a component cannot be placed inside a post
// body. Putting it in the layout puts it on all of them with no per-post edits
// and nothing to maintain when a new post is written.
//
// The snapshot page had zero inbound links before this. This is also the fix
// for that.
//
// This is a preset, not its own markup. The layout and styling live in
// CtaBanner.astro, which takes props and can be dropped anywhere. Keeping the
// copy here means the wording can change without touching the shared component,
// and the shared component stays proven because it renders on 137 pages.
import CtaBanner from './CtaBanner.astro';
---

<CtaBanner
  id="snapshot-cta-heading"
  eyebrow="Free assessment"
  heading="What is the gap costing you?"
  body="22 questions, about 5 minutes. You get a score across 4 areas, the weakest one named, and a rough annual figure for the hours you spend on work someone else could do."
  href="/ai-readiness-snapshot"
  buttonText="Take the AI readiness snapshot"
  note="No card, no call, result on screen"
/>
